Project layout:

source   --> source code of java modules
output   --> build output
keys.jks --> keystore for private key for signing

Building this project:

compile
```sh
javac @compile
```
package as jar
```sh
jar @package
```
build javadoc
```sh
javadoc @docs
```
sign jar
```sh
jarsigner @sign
```
clean build output
```sh
rm -r output/
```

A one full build process can be executed by running the `build.java` file.
```sh
java --enable-preview build.java
```

Command to setup a keystore:
```sh
keytool -genkeypair -alias jar -keyalg RSA -keystore keys.jks -validity 365 -storepass popopo -keypass popopo -dname "cn=Oliver Jan Krylow, ou=R&D, o=isp-insoft GmbH, c=DE" 
```

Command to start jshell with `lib` module loaded:
```sh
jshell --module-path output/modules --add-modules lib
```

